	(text "HAT+ ID EEPROM (Raspberry Pi HAT+ specification, chapter 3):\naddress 0x50 (Standard class), 3.9k pull-ups on ID_SD/ID_SC, write protect held high by 1k.\nPull TP1 low, or bridge JP1, to write the EEPROM. Nothing else may connect to ID_SD or ID_SC."
